# Config File Schemas

All configs use YAML. Follow these exact schemas.

## Species Config (`configs/species/<name>.yaml`)

```yaml
species:
  name: deer
  type: herbivore        # herbivore | predator | omnivore

morphology:
  num_legs: 4
  joints_per_leg: 3      # hip, knee, ankle
  total_joints: 12       # num_legs * joints_per_leg
  body_mass_kg: 70.0
  body_length_m: 1.5

observations:
  joint_pos_dim: 12
  joint_vel_dim: 12
  body_orientation_dim: 4    # quaternion
  body_angular_vel_dim: 3
  gravity_projection_dim: 3
  velocity_command_dim: 3
  height_scan_points: 100
  context_token_dim: 11
  total_obs_dim: 148         # sum of above (without velocity_command for ecosystem)

actions:
  type: joint_position_targets
  dim: 12
  scale: 1.0

rewards:
  velocity_tracking_weight: 1.0
  energy_penalty_weight: -0.001
  feet_air_time_weight: 0.5
  body_height_weight: -0.5
  orientation_penalty_weight: -1.0
  survival_bonus: 0.1
  # Species-specific (ecosystem phase)
  flee_predator_weight: 2.0    # herbivores only
  forage_weight: 1.0           # herbivores only

domain_randomization:
  friction_range: [0.5, 1.5]
  mass_variation_pct: 15
  motor_strength_variation_pct: 10
```

## Training Config (`configs/training/<experiment>.yaml`)

```yaml
experiment:
  name: deer_locomotion_rough
  max_iterations: 1500
  save_interval: 50

environment:
  num_envs: 1024          # NOT 4096 on 12GB VRAM
  env_spacing: 2.5
  episode_length_s: 20.0
  decimation: 4
  physics_dt: 0.005       # 200Hz physics, 50Hz policy

policy:
  actor_hidden_dims: [512, 256, 128]
  critic_hidden_dims: [512, 256, 128]
  activation: elu
  init_noise_std: 1.0

algorithm:
  name: ppo
  learning_rate: 0.001
  schedule: adaptive
  clip_param: 0.2
  entropy_coef: 0.005
  num_learning_epochs: 5
  num_mini_batches: 4
  gamma: 0.99
  lam: 0.95
  desired_kl: 0.01
  max_grad_norm: 1.0
  num_steps_per_env: 24
```

## Environment Config (`configs/environment.yaml`)

```yaml
terrain:
  type: procedural_rough
  size_m: [100, 100]
  resolution: 0.1
  roughness: 0.05

weather:
  initial_state: clear_sky
  transition_interval_s: 60.0
  meteor_probability_per_hour: 0.01

time:
  day_length_s: 600.0    # 10 min real = 1 day sim
  start_hour: 8.0
```
